### Create a new POC
POST http://localhost:4000/poc_gateway/poc/add_poc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "mod_poc_name": "Vetri",
    "mod_poc_role": "AP",
    "mod_poc_email": "vetri@gmail.com",
    "mod_poc_mobile": "26283847784"
}

### Get all POCs
GET http://localhost:4000/poc_gateway/poc/read_all_poc

### Get POC by mod_poc_id
GET http://localhost:4000/poc_gateway/poc/get_poc_by_poc_id/9ccefe74-f80c-4427-804e-827a61d7619a

### Get POC ID and MOD ID by user_id
GET http://localhost:4000/poc_gateway/poc/mod_id_poc_id/528f7cb8-0bfe-4366-a98d-831719ec53e6

### Update POC details
PUT http://localhost:4000/poc_gateway/poc/update_poc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "mod_poc_id": "9ccefe74-f80c-4427-804e-827a61d7619a",
    "mod_id": "6503caf1-fb75-4640-99f2-d6a529b71205"
}

### Update only mod_tests and mod_users
PUT http://localhost:4000/poc_gateway/poc/update_mod_field
Content-Type: application/json

